<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34134" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμμέλεια</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμμελής</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>harmony in music</i> or <i>the fit modulation of spoken
				words</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				50
			</span></i>: generally, <i>harmony, gracefulness</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασῴζειν τὴν ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.747b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀγριοφανῆ καὶ
			αὐστηράν</span>, of Pan, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				27
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ παρέργως, ἀλλὰ μετά τινος
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.217a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a tragic dance</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρρίχη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				816b
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίκιννις</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρδαξ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.20e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.631d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; <i>the tune of this dance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Com.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κονδύλου</span>
			knuckle-<i>dance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1503
			</span></i>.</div>
